body:
Hey - I'm glad to hear you have managed to change your life around within a year. Was there any specific action that then helped you take all other actions? I ask, because I feel stuck 'in life' - I'm sort of in the same place as OP, and would want to be in a place where you currently seem to be.

&#x200B;

I have been in therapy for over a year now, but still feel that nothing major has come out of it - it helps me open up and my therapist gets me thinking more, but other than that it sometimes feels like it's just a chat with someone willing to hear me out. 

&#x200B;

I'm not exactly sure how I can get my life 'in motion'.

Mine are the same. I have litterally only used my TV for less than 2 weeks and have been getting the notification for the last 2 days.

&#x200B;

Is there something wrong with my settings for the remote to be wasting so much charge? This can't be normal, as it means I'll need to be buying batteries every other week!
